{"id":"gewo_hnlich","lemma":"gewöhnlich","pos":"adv","rank":2174,"glosses":["usually"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈvøːnlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/De-gew%C3%B6hnlich.ogg/De-gew%C3%B6hnlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich gehe gewöhnlich um fünf heim.","en":"I usually go home at five.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760834","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"home, to the house"}]},{"text":"Reisen Sie gewöhnlich allein?","en":"Do you usually travel alone?","words":[{"g":"to travel"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"alone"}]},{"text":"Wir schlafen gewöhnlich in diesem Zimmer.","en":"We usually sleep in this room.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to sleep"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"room"}]},{"text":"Wann gehst du gewöhnlich ins Bett?","en":"When do you usually go to bed?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"into the"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"}]},{"text":"Ich esse gewöhnlich viel.","en":"I usually eat a lot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"essen"},null,{"g":"much, a lot"}]}]}